# INVWINRA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the reports'
# dialogs and the preview, with PAGE20.CFG's pages of 20 lines.  The
# Reports menu lists the five reports; the item listing's dialog shows
# INV's options and their first values; Alt and a label's letter moves
# the focus to the output's list and to the file, and back to the
# category.  FILE output without a name is refused under the fields, the
# focus on the file, and so is a device's name; with a name the report is
# written and a box says so, then the dialog opens again with the values
# kept.  OK again asks before the file is replaced, and No goes back to
# the dialog, the focus on the file.  The valuation on SCREEN shows in
# the preview, its two pages on one screen, and ESC leaves for the
# dialog; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R
S REPORTS
K I
S LISTING
K ALT-O
S ALTO
K ALT-F
S ALTF
K ALT-C ALT-O
T F
K ENTER
S NOFILE
T CON
K ENTER
S BADNAME
K BS BS BS
T RPT.TXT
K ENTER
S DONE
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ENTER
S REPLACE
K N
S KEPT
K ESC
K ALT-R V ALT-O
T S
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ESC
S BACK
K ESC
K ALT-F X
